Route every capability that can change a path through IPlayerContext rather than
the mutable JVM-wide settings object. CalculationContext snapshots those values,
and copied-chunk BlockStateInterface instances freeze the host's cell authority
before a worker starts. PrecomputedData receives the route's vine decision when
it is constructed so its worker-lazy cache cannot borrow a later bot's setting.

